after a call, if nextAction exists
after a call, if followUpDate is set
after sending proposal, if you need to check back
after meeting/demo, if another step is pending
when user manually clicks Add Follow Up
Practical example:

lead is Contacted
you speak to them
they say “call me Friday”
system saves call log
system creates follow-up:
type: Call
dueAt: Friday
status: Pending
now that lead shows on Follow Ups page